                    "function_body": "void CARLAControlCmd(\n    double targetSpeed,\n    double targetAccel,\n    double steerRad,\n    int enable,\n    int *status)\n{\n    extern int carla_adapter_publish_control_cmd(\n        double targetSpeed,\n        double targetAccel,\n        double steerRad,\n        int enable);\n    int rc = 0;\n\n    rc = carla_adapter_publish_control_cmd(targetSpeed, targetAccel, steerRad, enable);\n    if (status != 0) {\n        *status = rc;\n    }\n}",
